<title>USA: GOLF-LEADING SCORES AFTER FIRST ROUND OF WESTERN OPEN.</title>
<headline>GOLF-LEADING SCORES AFTER FIRST ROUND OF WESTERN OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>LEMONT, Illinois 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores after</p>
<p>the first round Thursday at the $2 million Motorola Western</p>
<p>Open played on the 7,073-yard, par-72 Cog Hill course (players</p>
<p>U.S. unless stated):</p>
<p>66 Mark O'Meara</p>
<p>67 Dave Stockton Jr, Jim Furyk, Tiger Woods, Phil Blackmar</p>
<p>68 David Duval</p>
<p>69 Tommy Armour, Mike Hulbert, Andrew Magee, Jeff Sluman,</p>
<p>Rafael Alarcon (Mexico), Steve Sticker, Michael Bradley, Tom</p>
<p>Purtzer</p>
<p>70 Hugh Royer, Billy Andrade, Mike Springer, Mark</p>
<p>Calcavecchia, Steve Lowery, Russ Cochran, Brent Geiberger, Tom</p>
<p>Pernice, Loren Roberts, Larry Mize, Brett Quigley</p>
<p>Other foreigners</p>
<p>71 Frank Nobilo (New Zealand), Stuart Appleby (Australia)</p>
<p>72 Vijay Singh (Fiji), Hideki Kase (Japan)</p>
<p>73 Grant Waite (New Zealand)</p>
<p>75 Fulton Allem (South Africa)</p>
<p>77 Mark Hensby (Australia)</p>
<p>79 David Frost (South Africa)</p>
<p>85 Phil Tataurangi (New Zealand)</p>
